{"parse": {"title": "LF-02", "pageid": 97029, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LF-01\" title=\"LF-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LF-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/LF-03\" title=\"LF-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B8.90.E5.BC.BA.E7.AC.A6.E5.8F.B7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"渐强符号\">渐强符号</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 渐强符号</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Crescendo</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>只<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>今<span class=\"color-value\"></span>天<span class=\"color-value\"></span>和<span class=\"color-value\"></span>昨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>天<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>延<span class=\"color-value\"></span>绵<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>断<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192202</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuiyishiting\"><img alt=\"jijinhuiyishiting\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员II：</div><div>“暴雨”是一种原因未明的时空灾害，“暴雨”来临前，世界会陷入某种“暴雨症候”中……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一名基金会的工作人员坐在发言席上，机械又刻板地介绍着一些贝蒂从未听说过的概念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白色的阶梯议事厅中坐满了人，他们的身份如贝蒂一样，都是“暴雨”幸存者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员II：</div><div>雨滴会从地面升上天空，随后，时代会在一瞬间更替。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂观察着神色各异的人们，但少有人像贝蒂如此失落。他们仿佛早就知道了这场灾难的降临，现在正悠然享受着这份信息差。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员II：</div><div>而圣洛夫基金会为大家提供了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂一个一个地看着议事厅中的人，从他们的衣着中推测着他们曾经的人生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>知更鸟蓝羊毛西装，裁剪合身，金丝棕条纹领带，左腕处戴着金表……证券人员吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>香槟色连衣裙搭配白色皮草披肩，珍珠项链……富太太吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂漫无目的地环视着自己的周围。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>贝雷帽，钓鱼马甲，说不定脸上还有个红鼻子，就像导演那样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>要真是导演就好了…… </div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_dongqujiedao2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_dongqujiedao2\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_dongqujiedao2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Cg-2_3_bg_dongqujiedao2.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_dongqujiedao2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Cg-2_3_bg_dongqujiedao2.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_dongqujiedao2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Cg-2_3_bg_dongqujiedao2.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_dongqujiedao2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这不是个好时代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜晚的街道如同丛林，仅剩的几点灯光像是萤火虫一般在黑暗中飘忽着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人路过了一处又一处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>经济萧条之下，人们睡的很早，因为这样不仅不用点灯，而且可以用睡眠来挨过饥饿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">男人：</div><div>饥饿……反正这一切马上就要过去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高礼帽上的金属钮扣时不时反着不知何处射来的光线，文明棍的首端碰撞粗糙的墙壁，发出声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他罔视巷口阴影处卧着的流浪汉们，脚步急切地走向半熄灯的餐馆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门紧闭着，从门上透光的玻璃中时不时能看到一个不停走动的人影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>模糊的灯光铺洒在柏油路面，于灯光中移动的影子停了一下，随后逐渐变大，遮掩住了本就不明亮的光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咔”，餐馆的招牌灭了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">男人：</div><div>等等！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人快跑了几步，终于来到了餐馆门前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">男人：</div><div>是我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>影子愣了一下，随后走向门口，卸下挡住门的厚木板，解开绕了几圈的铁链，才终于打开了锁住的门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">餐馆老板：</div><div>贝蒂？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人灿然一笑，摘下了高礼帽，一条蓬松厚实的麻花辫落在了他的肩膀上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">男人：</div><div>现在还有剩的肉吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人衣服下的身形似乎缓慢变化着，不一会，男人便变成了女人的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>要是有牛排就最好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">餐馆老板：</div><div>牛排？你怎么不去希尔顿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老板转身走向厨房，将贝蒂让了进来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_kafeiguan\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_kafeiguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">餐馆老板：</div><div>我这里只有胡佛炖菜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>多加点肉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂开心地笑着，黏在上唇的假胡子因为肌肉的拉扯而变得有些歪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她“啪”地将钱拍在了餐桌的吧台上，向老板冁然张开双臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>我获得了一个有台词的角色！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>这肯定是因为之前吃到了老板的胡佛炖菜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>多加点肉果然还是好吃的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老板正背对着贝蒂，搅拌着锅里已经冷到凝固的炖菜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">餐馆老板：</div><div>真的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>炉火催生出油脂的滋啦声，香气逐渐从铁锅中升起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>嗯哼！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂如同一名过生日的孩子，她将手扒在吧台上，全神贯注地期待着那份被老板的身躯挡住的炖菜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老板利落地用铁铲刮着锅壁，然后将炖菜推到贝蒂面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咚”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>盛满饭菜的盘子发出了敦实的声响，热气将饭菜的香味变得更加实在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">餐馆老板：</div><div>请你了，为那些你曾经背了却没用上的剧本，你值得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>谢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂抓起勺子，一勺又一勺地舀起这盘丰盛无比的炖菜，茄汁溅到了她白色的衬衫上，胃部也逐渐被灌入了充实感。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuiyishiting\"><img alt=\"jijinhuiyishiting\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂看着最前排的那个背影，攥紧了笔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>要是我的戏份能在“暴雨”来之前拍完就好了，那可是个有着三句台词的角色。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><span style=\"font-size:116%\">“是！”</span><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br />                                                                                                      <span style=\"font-size:277%\">1/3</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><span style=\"font-size:116%\">“不！”</span><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br />                                                                                                      <span style=\"font-size:277%\">2/3</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><span style=\"font-size:116%\">“啊——”</span><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br />                                                                                                      <span style=\"font-size:277%\">3/3</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂在脑中重复着自己已经演练百遍的台词和肢体动作，之前，每次想到这些画面，她都难掩喜悦。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuiyishiting\"><img alt=\"jijinhuiyishiting\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员II：</div><div>那么现在，大家可以把填好的表格交给我了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>职员的话截停了贝蒂的幻想，闻言，议事厅的人零零散散地站了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>气氛尽是沉默，人们排着队将手中填好的表格交到了演讲台上，由坐在那里的工作人员有条不紊地整理着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>每一次“暴雨”，圣洛夫基金会都会收容这样一群失去时代的人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>这里就像是……一个时代床头柜，现在收录的是我的时代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>那些没有加入的人呢？我的时代还能回来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看着人们逐渐走出了议事厅，一种被抛弃的恐慌感突然淹没了贝蒂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>不能掉队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她这么想着，于是急忙填好了表格，将它交到了工作人员的手里，随后跟着人群离开了会议室。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>迈出门，站在走廊中，贝蒂望向走廊的头和尾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同时代的人们没有停留，贝蒂看着他们的背影走向了视野的尽头，一步一步，直至被墙和墙的夹角吞没。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那份恐慌没有消失，那份表格也没有给她任何归属感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂摸了摸肚子，现在那里没有饥饿的感觉，但也并不饱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如果没有电影可拍，自己该去干什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_kafeiguan\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_kafeiguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">餐馆老板：</div><div>你会成为好莱坞的明星。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当灯光熄灭，餐馆的门再次锁上之前，老板这么对贝蒂说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">餐馆老板：</div><div>然后整日在香槟塔上醒来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>我该去看看琼斯，因为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我本来就没有香槟塔。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LF-02"}}